What was taken, from plugin/modes/code.json at commit 039c6160: the names and meanings of the
observation types and concepts, and the guidance on a title, a subtitle, a narrative and a fact
and on what to record and what to skip. It is cut down and reworded in the curator's prompt
(src/curate.rs, `prompt`) and named in src/cards.rs (`TYPES`, `CONCEPTS`). From the same file,
the request for a session summary and the guidance on its six fields (request, investigated,
learned, completed, next_steps, notes), reworded in the summary prompt (src/turns.rs, `prompt`).

From src/services/work-view/work-product.mjs at v15.1.0, with its tests
(tests/worker/work-view/work-product.test.mjs and work-product-git.test.mjs): the reading of what
a request produced (the commits, pushes, branches and pull requests of recorded git and gh
commands, the links publishing tools return, the files of kinds a person opens, the links attached
to work-state items) and their merge, ported to Rust and changed in src/work_product.rs: which
recorded calls are read is oboete's, and no file is served. From
src/ui/my-work/src/live/to-work-model.ts and src/ui/my-work/src/lib/product-icons.ts at v15.9.0:
which icon each kind of work product takes (`DELIVERABLE_KINDS` in assets/viewer/app.js). No
other code of Claude-Mem is included.

